\details{
Keyed on the layer itself rather than on the plot. ggplot2 \code{Layer} objects
are ggproto, ggproto objects are environments, and \code{identical()} on two
environments is a pointer comparison -- so the lookup is O(1) and exact,
where hashing or deep-comparing the plot could cost as much as the rebuild
